('La UNMSM tiene tres sedes. La Ciudad Universitaria (Av. Germán Amézaga 375, Lima) reúne 17 facultades. El Campus San Fernando (Av. Miguel Grau 755, Lima) alberga Medicina Humana —con Obstetricia, Enfermería, Nutrición y Tecnología Médica— y Farmacia y Bioquímica. El Campus San Borja (Av. Circunvalación 28) alberga Medicina Veterinaria.'::text, '{"title": "Sedes de la UNMSM", "place_id": null, "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-sedes"}'::jsonb, '[-0.017096654,-0.01677947,0.03534908,-0.055814344,0.02418838,-0.00509448,0.039185826,0.041624244,0.05058445,0.043195114,-0.022336574,0.00010605503,-0.018676741,0.017709214,0.17673175,-0.010221492,-0.030785551,-0.0073837945,0.015576403,-0.008972032,0.038965624,-0.006889486,-0.04686131,-0.008996039,-0.015408073,0.045093615,0.058695592,-0.021266378,0.020395514,-0.010226042,0.038668897,0.10959198,0.003489807,-0.010839374,0.008747906,0.01089745,0.0066275094,0.006998165,0.0005659796,0.0005576601,0.01824655,0.011629809,0.015053423,-0.023615932,0.020450981,-0.02961426,-0.0075404714,-0.07787817,0.018168222,0.012864415,-0.02415941,0.033643514,-0.04649576,-0.3337832,-0.0021677788,-0.0017365719,0.00071454607,0.0035297212,-0.024396766,-0.010983874,-0.035456654,0.07742971,-0.07590036,-0.034563944,-0.003892679,0.01546772,0.029476952,0.07209273,-0.030207511,0.0016929908,0.017346986,0.0022779366,0.049361546,-0.011624287,-0.022014624,-0.027386077,-0.023596467,0.059185583,-0.013845827,0.030245377,0.0137915695,0.040884126,-0.018444208,-0.013732475,0.016877174,-0.010944503,-0.003570539,0.014002133,-0.014106907,-0.019382503,0.0066422336,0.017257618,-0.032291733,-0.08572331,0.045785,0.014007408,0.03698282,-0.026364371,-0.025363771,0.004107358,-0.02758288,0.003967544,-0.011005302,0.014642562,0.029731287,-0.075024754,0.020678615,-0.027600845,0.024306187,0.0004928862,-0.008503899,0.014192098,0.0037592503,-0.012654547,0.040194925,-0.31375918,-0.013749951,0.016952943,-0.037876192,-0.038001172,0.03128582,0.061355878,0.001399919,0.013099637,0.025236418,