-salud-mental'::text),
('La UNMSM ofrece transporte gratuito. El bus interno, llamado "Burrito", recorre el perímetro de la Ciudad Universitaria de lunes a viernes de 7:30 a 18:00, con paradas cerca de las puertas principales. El bus externo gratuito sale desde los conos norte, sur y este y del centro de Lima a las 6:20 am y regresa por la tarde desde la explanada cercana a la Facultad de Derecho.'::text, '{"title": "Transporte Universitario", "place_id": null, "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-transporte"}'::jsonb, '[-0.0043010665,0.02907568,0.026628993,-0.045114703,0.0052253543,0.018647527,0.017923588,0.04176629,0.043014444,-0.012292053,0.005092428,0.016389007,-0.052445687,0.023991674,0.16629992,0.013166207,-0.018349564,-0.0149494745,0.0013232356,-0.044266,0.026412532,-0.023505494,-0.023743626,0.008364104,-0.047597528,0.0058297687,0.017952716,0.017520834,0.021171318,-0.020079693,-0.013105069,0.046735715,0.00041020827,-0.043218087,-0.024150712,-0.018451666,0.022948887,0.0040104794,-0.025409384,-0.025540221,0.02106014,0.0117562525,0.03662591,0.04875545,-0.0042596054,-0.025596125,-0.027302157,-0.09234988,-0.0015404285,-0.0029974245,-0.0075283954,0.011855871,0.03540322,-0.3184899,-0.04107981,0.012835079,-0.02025401,-0.012787175,-0.0017546318,-0.033849817,-0.04059594,0.068999514,-0.0668288,-0.0018839681,0.026911197,-0.012023555,0.0010380255,0.049427364,-0.037966996,-0.012277772,0.024591194,0.0026039237,0.029692777,-0.073066786,-0.02822044,-0.035349686,-0.03772963,0.018126283,-0.04482171,0.039132793,0.00017348296,0.03097828,0.036304537,0.011924179,0.028444245,0.018750148,-0.0014078068,-0.029115522,-0.026614672,-0.0020532426,-0.0014528789,0.055052914,0.002071918,-0.09194808,0.044234656,0.010098519,-0.006283452,-0.03010108,-0.038226828,-0.055670142,-0.044673573,0.009097376,0.022952193,0.032958455,0.03337065,-0.03363067,0.012847655,-0.0158992,0.0013066805,0.0041276873,0.0029120739,0.03820246,0.002676717,0.015498308,0.039131638,-0.27833086,0.022007544,0.022145536,-0.052592836,-0.054234568,0.0274