('La Facultad de Medicina "San Fernando" NO está en la Ciudad Universitaria: se ubica en la Av. Miguel Grau 755, en el distrito de Lima (Barrios Altos), a unos 5 km del campus principal. Ofrece las carreras de Medicina Humana, Obstetricia, Enfermería, Tecnología Médica y Nutrición, y atiende de lunes a viernes de 7:00 a 20:00.'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Medicina «San Fernando»", "place_id": null, "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-medicina"}'::jsonb, '[0.0140549,0.011900973,0.008877572,-0.06457634,0.010043321,-0.00810172,0.022240326,0.043095756,0.05513686,0.032583453,-0.020536494,0.002360174,-0.03315389,0.038137976,0.16018061,-0.02380143,-0.007447062,-0.01978434,-0.004173865,0.0008749217,0.03860475,-0.0015084161,-0.03879609,-0.015058196,-0.035935577,0.045835827,0.022037769,-0.006092495,0.0054048668,-0.010882675,0.01609209,0.08740886,0.01457255,-0.004503888,-0.008214835,0.028673463,0.011568047,-0.006031698,0.004298522,0.017760051,0.012954133,0.01721131,-0.00017651416,0.027094055,0.03774852,-0.022304175,0.011324684,-0.09262576,0.01847925,0.036144964,-0.011273269,0.038475603,-0.041491095,-0.31163135,-0.018550506,-0.015499682,0.03494521,-0.006995756,-0.016503962,-9.665573e-06,-0.031575266,0.040304694,-0.033748224,0.014696123,-0.014218446,0.037743412,0.01282755,0.08553728,-0.03231148,0.007018016,-0.020626456,-0.014588897,0.050926346,-0.023595577,-0.029059667,-0.035020918,-0.010164439,0.054598533,-0.006601989,0.026286734,-0.0178795,0.012188436,-0.0031066637,-0.013708793,0.027742704,-0.025488947,-0.031270873,-0.015459374,-0.035369523,-0.006574335,0.0140037555,0.025211211,-0.0034466223,-0.07463353,0.034867752,0.019943012,0.018325644,-0.023565337,-0.02257726,0.007098321,-0.020669952,0.009168695,0.012273698,-0.011932604,0.030675957,-0.05101979,0.013367289,-0.029665455,-0.01037338,0.0048381207,0.002604986,0.03533939,0.0063839513,-0.011861852,0.03161379,-0.3020205,0.0037610815,0.015185921,-0.010927755,-0.053662,0.028784331,0.04234996,-0.021679131,0.018195616,0.026929393,0.