('A los ingresantes o estudiantes de primer año se les llama "cachimbos". La UNMSM es una universidad pública y no cobra matrícula en la mayoría de las facultades; el comedor, el transporte interno y el gimnasio son gratuitos para los estudiantes matriculados. Se ingresa principalmente por el examen de admisión (dos veces al año, aproximadamente en marzo y septiembre), y también por ingreso directo'::text, '{"title": "Preguntas frecuentes: ingreso y costos", "place_id": null, "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-faq-ingreso"}'::jsonb, '[0.0036989648,0.016789597,0.049726304,-0.08809406,-0.0012776589,0.045991216,-0.01045095,0.012842543,-0.006397398,0.018212987,-0.01507608,0.02702037,-0.018609146,0.0075984,0.18441972,0.041650537,0.024388282,-0.005764281,-0.0034336527,-0.039106194,0.01588158,-0.031691454,-0.041818164,0.029076135,-0.019444183,0.022442177,0.03225838,-0.033646047,0.014873642,-0.015824785,-0.002105014,0.055965707,-0.015474662,0.0019407199,-0.03051682,-0.010601286,0.005787553,0.010278875,0.006719812,0.010193841,0.04512988,0.029785335,0.002017862,-0.03704441,0.024401266,-0.0277899,-0.017225906,-0.0482008,-0.0009592762,-0.009272507,-0.034024943,0.013858977,-0.009256792,-0.3486509,-0.025008028,0.009936131,-0.015476312,0.013292543,0.0043217246,-0.032028135,-0.07974611,0.050786346,-0.062069915,-0.0016101225,0.011487312,-0.008401872,0.014698141,0.06007847,-0.009587662,-0.033370737,0.025429554,-0.016713671,0.026680376,-0.010021748,-0.012460797,0.0043278025,-0.028610043,0.0020639182,-0.0164595,0.019153956,-0.03912708,-0.013241778,0.030051975,-0.008314357,0.014533346,-0.020584643,0.020164581,-0.044817396,-0.028265104,-0.004726516,-0.016544655,0.053891033,0.028830407,-0.08695456,0.009732506,0.015425364,-0.003405309,-0.034734413,-0.043008566,-0.048041563,-0.017414613,0.037551854,0.01577221,0.03842511,0.028324215,-0.03941035,-0.011503126,-0.015974678,-0.013198718,0.026770229,-0.008164782,-0.0013560182,0.017901555,0.0059843403,0.012881345,-0.2840523,0.00545247,0.008868616,