('El campus tiene acceso controlado, pero el público general puede ingresar presentando su DNI en las puertas; no es necesario ser estudiante para usar la Biblioteca Central o la Clínica. Hay WiFi universitario en varios puntos del campus. Para llegar en transporte público se puede usar el Metropolitano por la Av. Brasil o la Av. Venezuela, o las rutas de bus por las avenidas Venezuela, Colonial y'::text, '{"title": "Preguntas frecuentes: visitantes y accesos", "place_id": null, "position": 0, "document_id": "doc-faq-visitantes"}'::jsonb, '[0.011491859,0.0060935565,-0.014946618,-0.08445119,-0.007494171,0.031981617,0.009298115,0.06975407,-0.0039607687,-0.0012291275,0.028497191,0.011707014,-0.04669604,0.01932774,0.17858042,-0.010176205,0.010537009,-0.012881659,0.00030230958,-0.014216566,0.03992307,-0.014149459,-0.04054492,-0.016990414,-0.02331927,0.023429211,-0.008694635,-0.055532586,0.022313759,-0.017527545,-0.013964865,0.012364692,0.025637425,0.029608497,0.012053515,0.010977464,0.0044051963,-0.031296175,-0.025021864,0.0039285677,0.017873565,0.014054912,-0.020512935,0.026325485,0.013787014,-0.031437974,-0.011498653,-0.08120077,-0.017020069,0.019839883,0.0016388394,0.00813279,-0.011472455,-0.34366974,-0.0023609078,-0.05603886,0.016651163,0.02880307,-0.006390333,-0.055130456,-0.040972773,0.034390498,-0.05449567,-0.0044726944,0.002731566,0.002283298,0.042952213,0.046796188,-0.02358009,0.004122786,0.030619573,-0.022493469,0.05122392,-0.029374698,-0.04231551,-0.0008827878,-0.011760672,0.033814725,-0.019915067,0.0013495474,-0.056657683,-0.011300734,0.009669493,-0.0076447083,0.029749189,-0.022358442,0.040068008,-0.0371828,-0.021921916,-0.016791416,-0.039897524,0.037412338,0.03223637,-0.015841696,0.051318575,-0.0047741574,-0.00805409,-0.02194241,-0.04365294,-0.014146754,-0.0357279,-0.02419817,0.013256426,0.031773873,0.045885246,-0.03902495,0.040386807,-0.007154222,-0.008010211,0.047652353,0.024223115,0.00444449,0.0019458056,-0.029037751,0.015390087,-0.3148261,0.032106943,0.0