('Cafetería de la Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial. Cafetería famosa por sus sándwiches y café. Cuenta con vending machines en el lobby. La Cafetería de la Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial es conocida por sus sándwiches y café, y cuenta con máquinas expendedoras (vending machines) en el lobby. Ofrece además venta de alimentos, snacks y bebidas. Atiende de lunes a sábado de 9:00 a 20:00. Categoría:'::text, '{"title": "Cafetería de la Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial", "place_id": "cafeteria-industrial", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-cafeteria-industrial"}'::jsonb, '[0.0025837081,0.015275925,0.02519574,-0.10115973,-0.021899745,-0.004531433,-0.0066119595,0.04819999,-0.019737838,0.00035261767,-0.0075546047,-0.0025094368,0.0070758276,0.02196275,0.18877564,0.007713773,0.021878723,-0.02703193,0.024713011,-0.060920335,-0.0001790428,-0.049994048,0.00710818,-0.017290521,-0.045788612,0.016119894,0.029106343,0.002623411,0.010743839,-0.0039096097,-0.021490648,0.04636619,0.042552125,0.033257138,-0.029552408,0.0037509787,0.025559468,-0.03045061,-0.009692325,0.026477091,0.012686727,0.021241503,-0.010809557,0.034050234,0.031555966,-0.023659393,0.04099564,-0.028740078,0.030263381,0.017588504,0.017967679,0.020919502,0.005456754,-0.31282312,-0.0023902578,-0.0048232297,-0.024736384,0.027687658,-0.00529401,-0.052481562,-0.044735786,0.026607541,-0.057122126,-0.009189432,-0.030485885,-0.0036144427,0.027369583,0.018796667,-0.0024883146,-0.028879944,0.005298898,-0.042371217,-0.011263149,-0.004427896,-0.031085292,-0.0278776,0.007534241,0.017666202,-0.004022508,0.05470224,0.0071806335,-0.028453067,0.028584499,-0.040995765,0.04487133,0.027595542,0.028125415,0.046410695,-0.004716796,0.027184919,-0.04413819,0.040363673,0.012305126,-0.017221509,-0.013617776,-0.0066969832,0.009395806,-0.012015988,-0.030940302,-0.02847943,-0.036378197,-0.021352395,0.008924647,-0.040430058,0.031222189,-0.04447051,0.02381283,-0.0074169477,-0.031656403,0.034523677,-0.02561548,0.04612254,0.0003487905,-0.039030