('Centro Preuniversitario UNMSM (CEPREUNMSM). Academia preparatoria oficial de la UNMSM. Los alumnos que ocupan una vacante en el cuadro de méritos acceden a la UNMSM sin rendir el examen ordinario. El Centro Preuniversitario UNMSM (CEPREUNMSM) está en la Av. Amézaga 60, dentro de la Ciudad Universitaria, y es la academia preparatoria oficial de la universidad. Prepara a los postulantes para el'::text, '{"title": "Centro Preuniversitario UNMSM (CEPREUNMSM)", "place_id": "cepreunmsm", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-cepreunmsm"}'::jsonb, '[0.013129004,-0.0127158025,0.042096287,-0.09753227,-0.0053600906,0.060410377,0.037348457,0.010852703,0.017707437,0.0073181815,-0.051644843,-0.006770653,-0.026111256,-0.0037907816,0.19313574,0.0041922634,-0.0034267379,-0.010050477,-0.0003756116,-0.03510574,0.015778575,-0.02058651,-0.02256826,0.03187523,-0.0008079704,0.053373434,0.02701344,-0.014899135,0.021904804,-0.00012222899,-0.029664688,0.07473338,0.012786869,-0.017739953,0.017622313,0.008729355,-0.008237778,-0.031483065,-0.023305515,-0.0043022716,0.06506808,0.014283628,0.002790498,-0.016171578,0.04936619,-0.0323613,-0.039645225,-0.08311116,-0.0057732835,0.0104912035,-0.010962258,0.04713117,-0.020627122,-0.3680296,0.02273612,0.009633079,-0.02997739,0.01286721,0.0017596515,-0.029967139,-0.057382308,0.08064227,-0.043452345,-0.02768414,-0.028503202,-0.009387906,0.01906612,0.034620076,-0.024549915,-0.0141825285,0.022862444,-0.024180336,0.025819905,0.0011474235,-0.0010549779,-0.0125255715,-0.029912522,0.018472346,-0.025907243,-0.0138637135,-0.0035366681,0.013610318,-0.009556391,0.014421412,0.011110061,0.010184034,-0.00268437,-0.016441261,-0.010364116,-0.026359957,-0.033493467,0.040349457,-0.008302074,-0.05581923,0.017152276,0.002342246,0.0013251199,-0.015664501,-0.047996283,-0.025479116,-0.027790215,0.026107416,-0.01784436,0.020948377,0.048867237,-0.07515652,-0.02195074,-0.0029984424,-0.014299925,0.008468516,-0.017952368,0.017841812,0.004845172,-0.0009963942,0.036976464,-0.314327