('Clínica de Odontología UNMSM. Forma odontólogos y cuenta con clínica propia donde los estudiantes realizan prácticas supervisadas. Ofrece atenciones a precios accesibles para la comunidad universitaria y público general. La Clínica de Odontología UNMSM es un centro donde se forman odontólogos y los estudiantes realizan prácticas supervisadas. Su horario de atención es de lunes a viernes, de 9:00 a'::text, '{"title": "Clínica de Odontología UNMSM", "place_id": "clinica-odontologia", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-clinica-odontologia"}'::jsonb, '[-0.017141195,-0.016328845,0.015264772,-0.08217803,0.015065146,-0.0013671485,-0.0110494895,0.034349743,0.0022831287,-0.012106893,-0.024924502,-0.020377554,-0.041700557,0.02145909,0.17271349,0.022364963,-0.039263707,-0.0103936475,0.014269561,-0.026756652,0.03536229,-0.030236427,-0.013133328,0.014314756,-0.00040005334,0.011018784,0.06583366,-0.011647108,-0.0005461726,0.0103658205,-0.016242316,0.057693694,0.03103785,-0.025545297,-0.0014014501,0.015499979,0.013649639,0.005093689,-0.018807434,0.021351505,0.03200184,0.029567474,-0.0089916,-0.007421923,0.03822759,-0.019020058,-0.034925863,-0.06048925,0.020433314,0.020630952,0.007036303,0.029430611,-0.022415321,-0.34738776,-0.0063884603,0.0019359473,-0.03157131,-0.021806026,0.021015966,-0.016653799,-0.030464992,0.07252337,-0.01878544,0.002266718,0.0039569386,0.0028249454,-0.013721546,0.060428858,-0.026153928,0.017952055,0.024395939,-0.014542709,0.0255533,-0.006957434,-0.039786607,-0.009129627,-0.011171317,0.056183714,-0.04285285,0.009614873,0.008527916,0.035538055,-0.017964851,0.034447897,0.02578923,0.014517496,-0.000702772,0.009321958,-0.0028872755,0.012641864,-0.009717264,0.0076674386,-0.009849531,-0.059639625,0.024197461,0.032002736,0.0075547867,-0.035403453,0.006878017,-0.07157396,-0.045005757,0.012733216,0.0015197718,0.029731197,0.0020911482,-0.06010704,-0.034021366,-0.011762095,-0.0034770195,0.03624772,-0.01761154,0.015160193,0.008758101,0.0029486462,0.026950281,-0.33467