('Escuela de Posgrado UNMSM. Ofrece 130 programas de maestría, 34 de doctorado y 133 de segundas especialidades en las 5 áreas del conocimiento de la universidad. La Escuela de Posgrado (DGEP) está en la Av. Amézaga de la Ciudad Universitaria y atiende de lunes a viernes de 8:00 a 20:00. Categoría: Administración. Horario: Lun–Vie 8:00–20:00.'::text, '{"title": "Escuela de Posgrado UNMSM", "place_id": "posgrado", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-posgrado"}'::jsonb, '[-0.023435967,-0.019601999,0.034712266,-0.0715274,0.017723288,0.049496762,-0.019295959,0.043413233,0.030244166,-0.018357195,-0.056234263,-0.02494819,-0.02186641,0.032123823,0.17827067,0.0048603215,-0.020074531,-0.003387877,-0.016837822,-0.02450647,0.026585925,-0.027411306,-0.010199686,-0.0181113,-0.037250433,-0.017165229,0.00083599,-0.0072200582,0.020157494,-0.011919497,-0.025543919,0.07531308,0.0036867321,-0.03886128,0.013521596,-0.013049622,-0.014806789,-0.011469117,-0.020357206,-0.004632722,0.024875622,-0.0020022162,-0.02041869,0.019568607,0.010559963,0.013695879,-0.046543915,-0.07156913,-0.03376496,0.01128631,-0.046081018,-0.004822434,-0.0006589775,-0.33703876,0.008588092,-0.0011001825,-0.01075157,-0.04965903,0.016701989,-0.020460766,-0.06251861,0.03790134,-0.03512606,0.0046279132,-0.027483169,-0.011357268,0.012771718,0.069129296,-0.01359373,-0.0034157396,-0.00430913,-0.019544581,-0.0149764,-0.019286754,-0.034797385,0.021713465,-0.0076383273,0.022262922,-0.03917784,0.017578924,0.0014225813,0.027423263,0.007092216,-0.02656551,0.016755415,0.01860528,-0.011560914,-0.023290863,-0.030869925,0.004168762,-0.012776787,0.028021673,-0.00604197,-0.07204647,0.027162699,0.0049293316,0.00255432,-0.022267705,-0.023208782,0.008340812,-0.01960145,0.021794355,0.023791432,0.014649339,0.022436658,-0.050430123,0.012247518,-0.0309427,-0.003048473,0.012129493,0.0008340849,0.0060089054,0.025159622,0.006337333,0.031993076,-0.3149354,0.04843498,0.008770223,-0.037131824,-0.035549287,0.014818872,0.038413417,-0.0145308925,0.