('Facultad de Ciencias Sociales. Patio interior con mesas y bancas de uso libre para estudiantes de toda la universidad. Muy cercana al Estadio Olímpico. La Facultad de Ciencias Sociales (FCCSS) ofrece carreras de Sociología, Antropología, Trabajo Social, Arqueología, Ciencia Política y Geografía. Tiene un patio interior de uso libre y está muy cerca del Estadio Olímpico. Categoría: Facultades.'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Ciencias Sociales", "place_id": "facultad-de-ciencias-sociales", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-facultad-de-ciencias-sociales"}'::jsonb, '[0.03401219,0.0207091,0.022502666,-0.091000825,-0.0058566756,0.02247052,-0.031014971,0.05808844,0.012940516,0.029786505,-0.024091104,0.022622008,0.001901845,0.050269783,0.20097326,-0.016522225,0.008468542,-0.023832388,0.0089098755,-0.016772471,0.00066425826,-0.034427904,-0.029306956,-0.027844751,-0.04032537,0.018963456,-0.017661314,-0.03316716,0.0017328514,-0.04958089,-0.018946262,0.08565931,0.027481308,0.0033571445,0.0022512095,-0.005310475,0.0032450361,-0.033881776,-0.010693791,-0.017053341,0.0232149,-0.0005816221,-0.005964712,0.03203462,0.04437128,-0.0044395295,0.009189871,-0.05869523,0.030823918,-0.00536534,0.0008064329,0.016711531,0.0068939882,-0.34366477,-0.0291227,-0.022854071,-0.003188503,-0.014707452,-0.026192581,-0.024971187,-0.027481848,0.05741042,-0.05488167,-0.039642442,-0.0077216337,0.007321296,0.011530348,0.050597593,-0.06211602,0.0048230737,0.01592099,-0.014703468,0.032902878,-0.044950105,-0.017546121,-0.0074428944,-0.017702295,0.017710412,-0.010847036,0.06602424,0.008903694,0.00437098,-0.0069401064,-0.019965626,0.02589064,-0.01222631,0.007013499,0.029710636,0.0025062351,-0.0060107014,0.013945835,0.025035549,-0.023365434,-0.027818754,0.056436487,-0.016038386,-0.02405174,-0.04653155,-0.02662154,0.004623305,-0.0012750771,0.016275225,0.009481157,0.021390567,0.0026734807,-0.021119526,0.008992641,-0.017353535,-0.030053435,0.034256358,-0.0040407735,0.0032599878,-0.03169898,0.024860695,0.059703