('Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática (FISI). Una de las mejores facultades de informática del Perú según múltiples rankings. Cuenta con laboratorios de cómputo modernos y grupos de investigación activos. La Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática (FISI) está en la Av. Amézaga, en el extremo norte del campus, y atiende de lunes a sábado de 8:00 a 22:00. Ofrece las carreras de'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Ingeniería de Sistemas e Informática (FISI)", "place_id": "fisi", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-fisi"}'::jsonb, '[0.018741844,0.018857416,0.011088022,-0.09829076,-0.02450579,0.016335582,0.02631541,0.061200824,0.024965538,-0.020356255,-0.055323776,0.0052551543,-0.014211141,0.042265415,0.16179395,0.022366151,-0.015199624,-0.022878995,0.008121954,-0.005549213,-0.0054627657,-0.02154139,-0.043460343,-0.025822913,-0.039827343,0.03300916,0.022695096,-0.06284709,0.022277597,-0.038368866,-0.018433584,0.055465426,0.037273467,-0.006901322,-0.015902981,0.0066160494,0.03264705,-0.019361245,-0.015080051,0.039382756,0.035958443,0.024656862,-0.011516658,0.01620017,0.019947214,-0.024888588,0.007760311,-0.043044418,0.014802735,0.03502495,0.004581701,0.019898154,0.0032701078,-0.35380575,0.028382774,-0.03613481,0.015079494,-0.01501036,-0.022152305,-0.05751645,-0.004772223,0.05701495,-0.043723226,0.0021292279,-0.016951758,-0.005922583,0.018737415,0.04356329,0.012421101,-0.014953901,-0.0071536344,-0.03436824,0.018192545,-0.016826775,-0.006414984,0.0038515336,-0.002239988,0.012109961,-0.009125959,0.029395744,-0.019745516,-0.006817984,0.019162651,-0.014369723,0.021139082,-0.0025923515,-0.015471006,0.026116978,-0.034281608,-0.021854205,-0.017256785,0.027880514,-0.059907693,-0.042567257,0.021694552,-0.011694287,-0.0010232743,0.0027273209,-0.04258995,0.009977708,-0.030249218,0.0050350097,0.010244104,0.030467838,0.01004013,-0.05525928,0.022407068,-0.03769568,0.0021095204,0.00411939,-0.024886725,0.020148376,0.0011377233,-0.014324885,0.033889547,-0.30755463,-0.000