('Facultad de Ingeniería Electrónica y Eléctrica. Fundada en 1969. Pabellón nuevo con acceso para personas con discapacidad, sala de estudio y comedor en el tercer piso. Laboratorios de electrónica, telecomunicaciones y biomédica. La Facultad de Ingeniería Electrónica y Eléctrica (FIEE) ofrece las carreras de Ingeniería Electrónica, Eléctrica, de Telecomunicaciones y Biomédica. Su pabellón nuevo'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Ingeniería Electrónica y Eléctrica", "place_id": "facultad-de-ingenieria-electronica-y-electrica", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-facultad-de-ingenieria-electronica-y-electrica"}'::jsonb, '[0.027113248,0.0076722694,0.02866239,-0.08642243,-0.0184725,-0.008995417,0.0070752394,0.04633356,0.021602558,-0.004821703,-0.0455692,0.027275011,-0.0072003854,0.07386608,0.16993421,0.043836623,0.0023376662,-0.03343772,0.0030625432,-0.04117112,0.0139923375,-0.049276102,-0.04221321,0.0025593431,-0.046682674,0.049855072,0.018062595,-0.007989635,0.022730073,-0.058701262,-0.010797925,0.07201673,0.03002913,0.008014572,-0.003331173,-0.021549907,0.009541806,-0.03050342,0.0075080455,0.0107039325,0.02969176,0.018134156,-0.045566503,0.0169656,0.02652474,-0.04347517,-0.019901559,-0.02866676,0.008748631,0.015296511,0.022657365,0.025810009,-0.006272554,-0.36532152,-0.0099969,-0.025353966,-0.013625304,0.025044754,-0.0012258311,-0.034041155,-0.025468394,0.039567936,-0.05147838,-0.014574801,-0.023704248,-0.0020585572,0.015258002,0.0014368016,-0.017446607,0.029091202,0.010254291,-0.025468452,0.025596265,-0.03053287,-0.040905055,0.0049965438,-0.0042581675,0.017384926,-0.020653976,0.04483223,-0.02282539,-0.003936311,0.025099559,-0.031784054,0.03324933,0.0006711121,-0.017503368,0.03385412,-0.024490166,-0.037590094,-0.0036164927,0.041448247,0.01091699,-0.03144634,0.008344143,0.009915111,0.007941175,-0.018658984,-0.029731546,-0.013485676,-0.006356034,-0.010036055,-0.0021965802,0.049772486,0.030637834,-0.04458554,0.021196537,-0.023617268,-0.0037661507,-0.0048072245,-0.0028160