('Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial. Creada en 1988. Acreditada internacionalmente. Excelente nivel académico. La Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial (FII) ofrece la carrera de Ingeniería Industrial, está acreditada internacionalmente y su cafetería es famosa por sus sándwiches y café. Categoría: Facultades. Horario: Lun–Sáb 8:00–22:00. Carreras: Ingeniería Industrial. Teléfono: 619-7000.'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial", "place_id": "facultad-de-ingenieria-industrial", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-facultad-de-ingenieria-industrial"}'::jsonb, '[0.020207647,0.0226637,0.017253095,-0.086060226,-0.010600981,-0.008961748,0.0006818208,0.031645406,0.020184416,0.0099978065,-0.033976123,0.035084706,-0.0020290646,0.056386814,0.17238559,0.029129982,0.016987605,-0.0056324326,0.016203571,-0.054526906,-0.008581685,-0.0667119,0.0015221045,-0.020085229,-0.030034639,0.018602844,0.044393804,-0.02186943,0.026641384,-0.022409128,-0.024255222,0.057522714,0.039762914,0.011207326,-0.018042117,-0.02053611,0.04059309,-0.018932937,-0.004963001,0.002936866,0.06078492,0.03241525,-0.021462705,0.016794777,0.035341743,-0.016007043,0.025862854,-0.0592956,0.02854436,0.011754915,0.04643935,0.0017580731,-0.026599474,-0.32625678,-0.01437352,-0.024702894,0.0079588555,0.01516593,-0.019864015,-0.039170913,-0.017351335,0.034317378,-0.05221774,0.00016628059,-0.040180158,-0.0041797888,-0.0012178113,0.044150908,0.028791912,-0.01244928,-0.0048091663,-0.009847646,-0.010750585,-0.017979803,-0.020631285,-0.036848422,-0.0072928336,0.037495714,0.0021330793,0.047469463,-0.00021599558,-0.026871437,0.026293632,-0.012861176,0.05745488,0.009637965,0.02163926,0.03409361,-0.03214036,0.02661175,-0.00591604,0.022603152,-0.033521697,-0.02348834,0.0046078037,-0.0032199263,0.009998761,-0.014154892,-0.03462886,-0.035552736,-0.0003156299,-0.011805013,0.03125799,0.009619348,-0.0010348323,-0.05563304,0.042146027,-0.019961743,-0.00485634,0.024981234,-0.0067652245,0.03583626,-0.005706766,-0.01778566,0.03