('Facultad de Letras y Ciencias Humanas. Única universidad de Lima con carrera de Historia del Arte y única del Perú con Conservación y Restauración. Tiene tres auditorios, biblioteca especializada y Centro de Idiomas. La Facultad de Letras y Ciencias Humanas (FLCH) está en el patio central histórico del campus y ofrece carreras como Literatura, Lingüística, Filosofía, Historia, Arte, Comunicación'::text, '{"title": "Facultad de Letras y Ciencias Humanas", "place_id": "facultad-de-letras-y-ciencias-humanas", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-facultad-de-letras-y-ciencias-humanas"}'::jsonb, '[0.011089299,-0.0008686439,0.056497548,-0.09035058,0.014974224,-0.00059786526,-0.004768937,0.03502705,-0.0029282304,-0.0025633164,-0.02260342,-0.0072320164,-0.057447325,0.03320574,0.16905206,0.02749271,-0.0038485767,-0.02859379,0.005317605,-0.0373052,0.022887588,-0.012440569,-0.021122765,0.021974016,-0.04035047,0.010828568,0.008568041,-0.004209426,-0.01980682,-0.023201283,-0.017297432,0.07330117,0.016934847,-0.03692911,0.01960428,0.02404609,0.006333873,-0.009642251,-0.021908965,0.014354672,0.017847912,0.06250657,0.009286034,0.006061201,0.059627295,-0.040462125,-0.010865393,-0.047426626,-0.004502547,0.0014830307,0.014570157,0.031545013,-0.00480657,-0.3518605,-0.012842326,0.000884394,-0.005960658,0.003978101,0.009884674,0.002632129,-0.04771842,0.0305265,-0.034248885,0.01698863,0.0017962243,0.050949894,-0.00012876566,0.07999698,0.010969023,-0.0053278753,-0.009458966,0.00831096,0.04890697,-0.0102202725,0.009468551,-0.014334203,-0.041232415,0.010691572,0.015443378,0.04275063,-0.008981664,0.02820776,-0.031810228,-0.025541892,0.036560263,-0.008027303,0.012609231,0.018769724,-0.01181685,-0.0043959315,-0.0091074,0.02083899,-0.026693754,-0.012834242,0.05425579,-0.003578902,-0.003188762,-0.018166201,-0.032353185,-0.025236977,-0.035744343,0.0104645565,0.014624378,0.04124414,0.00440126,-0.037457827,0.056087364,-0.008518544,-0.00010267695,0.024792308,-0.019776175,0.02564717,-0.03723033,-0.0