('Gimnasio Universitario. Uso gratuito para la comunidad sanmarquina. Ofrece canchas de fútbol, vóley y básquet, zona de pesas y equipos de ejercicio modernos de acceso libre. El Coliseo Deportivo y Gimnasio UNMSM está cerca de la Facultad de Ingeniería Industrial y atiende de lunes a viernes de 6:00 a 23:00 y sábados de 6:00 a 16:30. Categoría: Campos deportivos. Horario: Lun–Vie 6:00–20:00 · Sáb'::text, '{"title": "Gimnasio Universitario", "place_id": "gimnasio-universitario", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-gimnasio-universitario"}'::jsonb, '[0.005004692,0.0071274275,0.03282906,-0.09191943,0.019180922,0.014896885,0.03744512,0.036610376,0.019631943,-0.016042702,-0.043144107,-0.00759676,-0.03285673,0.038940858,0.16146785,0.040820897,0.0009790425,-0.012023117,-0.018597491,-0.013918398,0.025803437,-0.04645317,-0.010593165,-0.01805391,-0.01845973,0.015296045,0.030409575,-0.013137434,0.02059213,-0.011454107,-0.011291803,0.06656015,0.0025636605,0.0050770296,-0.000656607,-0.035912525,0.0027081126,-0.0028189113,-0.022621943,0.013588905,0.02224506,-0.0063027027,0.036339823,-0.008620704,0.009985963,-0.024316845,-0.0038993154,-0.04762707,0.007397817,0.0051405607,0.01603328,0.007450509,-0.026114885,-0.32699925,0.00030125902,0.015213228,-0.012094339,-0.0255554,-0.017157597,-0.017484544,-0.055442344,0.038307644,-0.074742496,-0.013064694,-0.014991031,0.007967855,0.02604269,0.019816365,-0.039911732,0.026304029,-0.010351664,-0.049639877,0.028574213,-0.023898935,-0.03054511,0.00027139793,-0.037182122,0.019103749,-0.032050613,0.037412453,-0.011452622,0.018126842,0.029057723,-0.00012082642,0.037789397,0.023000564,-0.0037769205,-0.00081543985,-0.041525085,-0.022464814,0.034733996,0.058568683,-0.003954794,-0.03145165,0.015659915,0.0336532,0.0030183864,-0.021329833,-0.020985136,0.0005085049,-0.010525706,0.0128001375,0.0050648213,0.03254977,-0.0155261075,-0.0252217,-0.005077055,0.007326764,0.008014808,0.014134869,-0.020727193,0.021712078,0.010906525,0.0018594294,0.026372327,-0.30174