('Es una gran estructura ceremonial construida por la Cultura Lima a partir del siglo V d.C., con ocupación posterior de las culturas Ichma e Inca. El acceso es libre para los universitarios y está protegida por ley, por lo que no debe deteriorarse. Categoría: Otros. Horario: Acceso libre dentro del campus.'::text, '{"title": "Huaca San Marcos", "place_id": "huaca-san-marcos", "position": 1, "document_id": "place-huaca-san-marcos"}'::jsonb, '[-0.03639884,0.025392028,0.03912831,-0.11455327,0.01872422,0.008939355,0.032747194,0.02139214,-0.0056900117,-0.006460485,0.023812052,-0.0343061,-0.025719833,0.03301765,0.16946205,0.019624844,0.010219707,-0.03510926,-0.022193331,-0.02437543,0.009931057,-0.041227948,-0.021473482,0.0085748155,-0.0048565143,-0.013105549,-0.0011228259,-0.029559411,0.01263403,0.002546381,-0.024743868,0.013223089,0.010224911,-0.043946456,0.0015450552,-0.0012619456,0.006477121,-0.02422077,0.0039836653,0.011911691,0.00902329,0.023978252,0.010032797,0.041545495,0.029765133,-0.02807729,-0.035988018,-0.09337096,0.014315703,0.016500054,0.019406497,-0.0012500335,-0.017782921,-0.34271976,-0.006075174,0.027586145,-0.02024494,-0.012584776,-0.0048537143,-0.009636395,-0.091380924,0.041599497,-0.040974643,-0.0035984698,0.01982736,0.027951583,0.016928954,0.060551647,-0.036233567,0.011003807,-0.02753868,-0.013979609,0.06910186,-0.027211018,-0.0062937983,-0.008361297,-0.03157742,0.012381352,-0.004518779,0.052737113,0.0020861789,0.008970497,-0.0055840896,-0.008444377,0.033653025,0.014832421,0.012062562,0.0034078504,-0.028534409,0.010457445,-0.005035091,0.029728347,-0.0057424507,-0.050747074,0.059457183,0.03512045,0.026493084,-0.03195049,-0.04310672,-0.02025041,-0.0028015166,0.017581435,0.023797525,-0.018976368,0.031271942,-0.030569037,0.013250845,-0.020259278,-0.00018023215,0.04211666,-0.02159728,0.071856216,0.01006592,0.020616328,0.019028727,-0.2946509,-0.0026346422,0.017324872,0.020113163,-0.08307652,0.017208783,0.027444843,-0.023621015,0.004328569,0.035222474,-0.014