('Oficina Central de Admisión (OCA). Gestiona todos los procesos de admisión de la UNMSM: examen ordinario, traslado interno y externo, ingreso directo por egresados, PIR (víctimas de terrorismo) y otros. La UNMSM realiza dos exámenes de admisión al año aprox. Uno en marzo y otro en septiembre. La Oficina Central de Admisión (OCA) atiende de lunes a viernes de 9:00 a 16:00 y gestiona todos los'::text, '{"title": "Oficina Central de Admisión (OCA)", "place_id": "oca", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-oca"}'::jsonb, '[-0.0013333104,-0.005575901,0.050285254,-0.10577433,0.0140800625,0.04801363,-0.00075614033,0.0095684,-0.0029963648,-0.016469816,-0.019600121,-0.023215126,-0.03971314,0.017001048,0.18661676,0.057013985,-0.010464641,0.0019319253,0.013442989,-0.050396953,-0.02453063,-0.03543487,-0.004215452,-0.0118072685,-0.035134457,0.016835995,0.040220305,-0.031429056,0.015933413,0.01650576,-0.062899314,0.048018545,-0.02736416,-0.018710304,-0.022057155,-0.017645882,-0.0029351823,0.01245453,-0.037876748,-0.013184376,0.042238887,-0.004246044,-0.008185887,0.012319013,0.0064687557,-0.044627514,-0.03142139,-0.09758869,-0.03490525,-0.025984943,-0.018390877,0.009051283,0.0033641297,-0.3491505,0.002468424,-0.009548375,0.0045920685,-0.015933495,-0.00844302,-0.030561043,-0.088599406,0.054001216,-0.03921875,-0.015794141,-0.0029778625,-0.021967094,0.012976979,0.0710844,-0.024026789,0.0034264494,0.016799418,-0.02908141,0.03229644,-0.002589046,-0.0006753827,-0.0137535175,0.005967671,0.018930921,-0.0021962181,0.0035704365,-0.0012163853,0.005444481,0.018531514,-0.00043877168,0.015614759,-0.019050956,0.010471223,-0.014179003,-0.006590466,0.000825017,0.0016891914,0.030847749,0.014126606,-0.07900649,0.053051434,0.02073165,-0.011847846,-0.017155483,-0.029070696,-0.03582638,-0.008731064,0.001289176,-0.022082085,0.015812442,0.04196446,-0.08770909,0.021218417,-0.029833741,0.0028881247,0.005385753,-0.017815614,0.032261223,0.0052285483,-0.018483808,0.01716569,-0.30973724,-0.008146969,-0.003886