('Rectorado (Edificio Jorge Basadre). El Rectorado, también conocido como Edificio Jorge Basadre, es la sede de la administración central de la Universidad Nacional Mayor de San Marcos, donde funcionan las autoridades y el gobierno universitario. Atiende de lunes a viernes de 8:00 a 16:00. Categoría: Administración. Horario: Lun–Vie 8:00–16:00.'::text, '{"title": "Rectorado (Edificio Jorge Basadre)", "place_id": "rectorado", "position": 0, "document_id": "place-rectorado"}'::jsonb, '[-0.021906499,0.016062364,0.042696014,-0.11280959,0.010402484,0.00031283597,0.016349422,0.023410281,-0.0002507559,-0.043057423,-0.03699428,-0.0137397945,-0.03454844,0.021739213,0.16906776,0.018822188,-0.03969373,0.0050792517,-0.025195962,-0.03365137,0.019466147,-0.056244474,0.005343925,0.0059275143,-0.016338997,0.008165234,0.002003445,-0.046303723,0.0057720346,0.006122543,-0.016207784,0.0676182,-0.0076083285,-0.058063764,0.016370783,-0.015047763,-0.025224084,0.009047039,-0.04744854,0.048016556,-0.0015145693,0.01790877,-0.008995419,0.03198639,0.016902745,-0.029598385,-0.016958911,-0.09196775,0.008680473,0.018848792,0.0064474638,0.01938021,-0.06644982,-0.33831906,-0.004232876,0.017238386,0.002755144,-0.023193741,0.007523277,-0.040038656,-0.058720004,0.047130127,-0.02711078,0.0010332871,0.0017901988,0.03729468,0.00811556,0.05684654,-0.0043631215,-0.021211397,0.006743,-0.005625459,0.002660198,-0.016016515,-0.032543737,0.021175977,-0.016247418,-0.006269108,-0.07156441,-0.019548424,-0.0057703643,0.028715184,-0.0066247396,0.009242357,0.029006852,-0.0016675259,0.020668605,0.04223872,-0.02214253,0.0085029155,-0.011925149,0.006818333,-0.009794384,-0.057236854,0.05585958,0.043011557,-0.012474943,-0.033429984,-0.02887528,-0.004870846,-0.037478242,0.009567704,-0.0129709495,0.015913099,0.04193958,-0.037975777,-0.008425384,-0.051530525,-0.02753634,-0.017447943,0.0073941117,0.022570722,0.025185393,-0.004544882,0.018070623,-0.30005237,0.031923715,0.010475447,-0.010765332,-0.0057898797,0.052595906,0.00524